  "description": "Ishimi, an imoogi trapped underground due to human greed. He regains his wits with the help of a strange child named Cheon-Seo who accidentally enters his world. In exchange for helping Cheon-Seo, who was born with unfortunate luck, avoid a near-death experience, Ishimi demands his blood, which will restore his vitality. And for some reason, Cheon-Seo accepts this dangerous bet without hesitation...?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
